@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8005

### API information
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Ask the RAG tutor a question
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the divergence theorem?",
  "document_ids": ["replace-with-a-document-id"]
}

### List ingested PDF documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/rag/documents
Accept: application/json

### Upload and ingest the Vector Calculus PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ingest
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VectorCalculusBoundary

--VectorCalculusBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Vector_Calculus_ Formulations_Applications_Python_Codes.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../kb/doc/Vector_Calculus_ Formulations_Applications_Python_Codes.pdf
--VectorCalculusBoundary--

### Upload and ingest the Introducing Algorithms in C PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ingest
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AlgorithmsBoundary

--AlgorithmsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Luciano_Manelli_Introducing_Algorithms_in_C_ A_Step_by_Step_Guide_to_Algorithms_in_C.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../kb/doc/Luciano_Manelli_Introducing_Algorithms_in_C_ A_Step_by_Step_Guide_to_Algorithms_in_C.pdf
--AlgorithmsBoundary--
